      359.06
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 19C of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to provide for the appointment of a Committee toadvice the Minister regarding any recommendation made by the Medical Council inrespect of any recognized university or institution under subsection (1) of section 19C.",
